# # # =============================================================================
# # # ENGLISH PAPER DETECTION & PARSER
# # # Handles 4 known English paper formats:
# # #   Format A (english_modal_*.docx):
# # #       Question-1  (own paragraph)  →  question text (next para)  →  (a)/(b)/(c)/(d)
# # #       Answer- (c)  →  Explain- …
# # #   Format B (ENGLISH_2024.docx):
# # #       Question 1. <text>  →  (A)/(B)/(C)/(D)
# # #       Correct Answer: (B)  →  Explanation:\n<text>
# # #   Format C (English_2022.docx):
# # #       1. <text>  →  (A)/(B)/(C)/(D)
# # #       Correct Answer: (C)  →  Explanation:\n<text>
# # # =============================================================================

